00:46.169 --> 00:49.031
You wanted a spark, we're giving you flames.

00:49.071 --> 00:52.072
We're done with the rules, we're done with the

00:52.112 --> 00:59.636
games. Hey! Push it to the red line, never

00:59.696 --> 01:02.138
looking back. Running off the rails, now

01:02.198 --> 01:04.879
jumping off the track. Hold on tight, we're

01:04.919 --> 01:09.061
losing control. This is the rhythm of a restless

01:09.341 --> 01:09.622
